 "checks": "212 players. The 689 players on Wikipedia's 100-cap list (24 August 2026 revision, which shows every cap up to the 2026 World Cup final) were matched to the game's Premier League player list by name (accents removed, first initial plus surname as a fallback) and nationality, then checked by hand: same-name players who are different people (Cafu, Marquinhos, Matheus Pereira, Lee Dixon, Gaston Ramirez) are left out. Every player's 100 caps were confirmed by Transfermarkt's match list counted to 19 July 2026 or RSSSF's century list; Jahanbakhsh (101) by RSSSF's 97 on 1 February 2026 plus the four games Transfermarkt lists since. Caps per player are in N5_p05_100caps_premier_league.csv. Players who reached 100 after 19 July 2026 (Robertson, van Dijk) are not included."
